{"translation":{"id":"eng_asv","name":"American Standard Version (1901)","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=eng-asv","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=eng-asv","license":{"attribution":"not-required","commercialUse":"allowed","derivatives":"allowed","copyleft":false,"publicDomain":true},"shortName":"ASV","englishName":"American Standard Version (1901)","language":"eng","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"154967f9f68504bdf9a8d7abaae4ef6a93f20f779df84e62c1c8828427731839","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/eng_asv/books.json","completeTranslationApiLink":"/api/eng_asv/complete.json","simpleCompleteTranslationApiLink":"/api/eng_asv/complete.simple.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31102,"languageName":"English","languageEnglishName":"English"},"book":{"id":"2TI","name":"2 Timothy","commonName":"2 Timothy","title":"THE SECOND EPISTLE OF PAUL TO TIMOTHY","numberOfChapters":4,"totalNumberOfVerses":83},"chapters":[null,{"numberOfVerses":18,"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["Paul, an apostle of Christ Jesus through the will of God, according to the promise of the life which is in Christ Jesus,"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["to Timothy, my beloved child: Grace, mercy, peace, from God the Father and Christ Jesus our Lord."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["I thank God, whom I serve from my forefathers in a pure conscience, how unceasing is my remembrance of thee in my supplications, night and day"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["longing to see thee, remembering thy tears, that I may be filled with joy;"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["having been reminded of the unfeigned faith that is in thee; which dwelt first in thy grandmother Lois, and thy mother Eunice; and, I am persuaded, in thee also."]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["For which cause I put thee in remembrance that thou stir up the gift of God, which is in thee through the laying on of my hands."]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["For God gave us not a spirit of fearfulness; but of power and love and discipline."]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["Be not ashamed therefore of the testimony of our Lord, nor of me his prisoner: but suffer hardship with the gospel according to the power of God;"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["who saved us, and called us with a holy calling, not according to our works, but according to his own purpose and grace, which was given us in Christ Jesus before times eternal,"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["but hath now been manifested by the appearing of our Saviour Christ Jesus, who abolished death, and brought life and immortality to light through the gospel,"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["whereunto I was appointed a preacher, and an apostle, and a teacher."]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["For which cause I suffer also these things: yet I am not ashamed; for I know him whom I have believed, and I am persuaded that he is able to guard that which I have committed unto him against that day."]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["Hold the pattern of sound words which thou hast heard from me, in faith and love which is in Christ Jesus."]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["That good thing which was committed unto thee guard through the Holy Spirit which dwelleth in us."]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["This thou knowest, that all that are in Asia turned away from me; of whom are Phygelus and Hermogenes."]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["The Lord grant mercy unto the house of Onesiphorus: for he oft refreshed me, and was not ashamed of my chain;"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["but, when he was in Rome, he sought me diligently, and found me"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["(the Lord grant unto him to find mercy of the Lord in that day); and in how many things he ministered at Ephesus, thou knowest very well."]}],"footnotes":[]}},{"numberOfVerses":26,"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["Thou therefore, my child, be strengthened in the grace that is in Christ Jesus."]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["And the things which thou hast heard from me among many witnesses, the same commit thou to faithful men, who shall be able to teach others also."]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["Suffer hardship with me, as a good soldier of Christ Jesus."]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["No soldier on service entangleth himself in the affairs of this life; that he may please him who enrolled him as a soldier."]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["And if also a man contend in the games, he is not crowned, except he have contended lawfully."]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["The husbandman that laboreth must be the first to partake of the fruits."]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["Consider what I say; for the Lord shall give thee understanding in all things."]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["Remember Jesus Christ, risen from the dead, of the seed of David, according to my gospel:"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["wherein I suffer hardship unto bonds, as a malefactor; but the word of God is not bound."]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["Therefore I endure all things for the elect’s sake, that they also may obtain the salvation which is in Christ Jesus with eternal glory."]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["Faithful is the saying: For if we died with him, we shall also live with him:"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["if we endure, we shall also reign with him: if we shall deny him, he also will deny us:"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["if we are faithless, he abideth faithful; for he cannot deny himself."]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["Of these things put them in remembrance, charging them in the sight of the Lord, that they strive not about words, to no profit, to the subverting of them that hear."]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["Give diligence to present thyself approved unto God, a workman that needeth not to be ashamed, handling aright the word of truth."]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["But shun profane babblings: for they will proceed further in ungodliness,"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["and their word will eat as doth a gangrene: of whom is Hymenæus and Philetus;"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["men who concerning the truth have erred, saying that the resurrection is past already, and overthrow the faith of some."]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["Howbeit the firm foundation of God standeth, having this seal, The Lord knoweth them that are his: and, Let every one that nameth the name of the Lord depart from unrighteousness."]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["Now in a great house there are not only vessels of gold and of silver, but also of wood and of earth; and some unto honor, and some unto dishonor."]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["If a man therefore purge himself from these, he shall be a vessel unto honor, sanctified, meet for the master’s use, prepared unto every good work."]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["But flee youthful lusts, and follow after righteousness, faith, love, peace, with them that call on the Lord out of a pure heart."]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["But foolish and ignorant questionings refuse, knowing that they gender strifes."]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["And the Lord’s servant must not strive, but be gentle towards all, apt to teach, forbearing,"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["in meekness correcting them that oppose themselves; if peradventure God may give them repentance unto the knowledge of the truth,"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["and they may recover themselves out of the snare of the devil, having been taken captive by him unto his will."]}],"footnotes":[]}},{"numberOfVerses":17,"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["But know this, that in the last days grievous times shall come."]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["For men shall be lovers of self, lovers of money, boastful, haughty, railers, disobedient to parents, unthankful, unholy,"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["without natural affection, implacable, slanderers, without self-control, fierce, no lovers of good,"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["traitors, headstrong, puffed up, lovers of pleasure rather than lovers of God;"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["holding a form of godliness, but having denied the power thereof: from these also turn away."]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["For of these are they that creep into houses, and take captive silly women laden with sins, led away by divers lusts,"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["ever learning, and never able to come to the knowledge of the truth."]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["And even as Jannes and Jambres withstood Moses, so do these also withstand the truth; men corrupted in mind, reprobate concerning the faith."]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["But they shall proceed no further: for their folly shall be evident unto all men, as theirs also came to be."]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["But thou didst follow my teaching, conduct, purpose, faith, longsuffering, love, patience,"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["persecutions, sufferings; what things befell me at Antioch, at Iconium, at Lystra; what persecutions I endured: and out of them all the Lord delivered me."]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["Yea, and all that would live godly in Christ Jesus shall suffer persecution."]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["But evil men and impostors shall wax worse and worse, deceiving and being deceived."]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["But abide thou in the things which thou hast learned and hast been assured of, knowing of whom thou hast learned them;"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["and that from a babe thou hast known the sacred writings which are able to make thee wise unto salvation through faith which is in Christ Jesus."]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["Every scripture inspired of God is also profitable for teaching, for reproof, for correction, for instruction which is in righteousness:"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["that the man of God may be complete, furnished completely unto every good work."]}],"footnotes":[]}},{"numberOfVerses":22,"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["I charge thee in the sight of God, and of Christ Jesus, who shall judge the living and the dead, and by his appearing and his kingdom:"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["preach the word; be urgent in season, out of season; reprove, rebuke, exhort, with all longsuffering and teaching."]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["For the time will come when they will not endure the sound doctrine; but, having itching ears, will heap to themselves teachers after their own lusts;"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["and will turn away their ears from the truth, and turn aside unto fables."]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["But be thou sober in all things, suffer hardship, do the work of an evangelist, fulfil thy ministry."]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["For I am already being offered, and the time of my departure is come."]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["I have fought the good fight, I have finished the course, I have kept the faith:"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["henceforth there is laid up for me the crown of righteousness, which the Lord, the righteous judge, shall give to me at that day; and not to me only, but also to all them that have loved his appearing."]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["Give diligence to come shortly unto me:"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["for Demas forsook me, having loved this present world, and went to Thessalonica; Crescens to Galatia, Titus to Dalmatia."]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["Only Luke is with me. Take Mark, and bring him with thee; for he is useful to me for ministering."]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["But Tychicus I sent to Ephesus."]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["The cloak that I left at Troas with Carpus, bring when thou comest, and the books, especially the parchments."]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["Alexander the coppersmith did me much evil: the Lord will render to him according to his works:"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["of whom do thou also beware; for he greatly withstood our words."]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["At my first defence no one took my part, but all forsook me: may it not be laid to their account."]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["But the Lord stood by me, and strengthened me; that through me the message might be fully proclaimed, and that all the Gentiles might hear: and I was delivered out of the mouth of the lion."]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["The Lord will deliver me from every evil work, and will save me unto his heavenly kingdom: to whom be the glory for ever and ever. Amen."]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["Salute Prisca and Aquila, and the house of Onesiphorus."]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["Erastus remained at Corinth: but Trophimus I left at Miletus sick."]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["Give diligence to come before winter. Eubulus saluteth thee, and Pudens, and Linus, and Claudia, and all the brethren."]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["The Lord be with thy spirit. Grace be with you."]}],"footnotes":[]}}]}
